{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1595.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"b871e0df6901e6c27b3bbd1579c1df9b28f6d9d71c7db71d06182438b0336c12","ja":"こだわりのクッキー作り！","zh":"用心制作的饼干！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1595.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"18601e73c16c793a59a8d36b16fd4b251305f9dea0bd33c187f19ab41950220e","ja":"小麦粉にバターに……うん、材料は大体買えたな。\nあとは型やけど、私が家から持ってきたのでいい？","zh":"面粉、黄油……嗯，材料差不多都买齐了。\n剩下的就是模具了，用我从家里带来的可以吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1595.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"a9f8d620412c0f8fbd4dc23d146462f5b149502d679829d87dca2e9c2ae920a0","ja":"ああ！　あと、ネットで調べたんだけど、\nカービングナイフでいろんな形にできるんだって！","zh":"啊！还有，我在网上查过了，\n据说用雕刻刀可以做出各种形状呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1595.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"35c7d939a93738397d909adcc356cd1dbd61f3cf7899e2952631e4633fa4b630","ja":"オレ、兄ちゃんたちが\nビックリするようなクッキー作りたいんだ！","zh":"我想做能让哥哥们\n大吃一惊的饼干！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1595.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"2931311bebf3b00a31b7f19bc10ada6f298f346601cbd12649b082a681f2e597","ja":"味だけやなくて、\n見た目でも楽しんでもらいたい、ってことやな。","zh":"不光是味道，\n还希望能让大家在视觉上也享受其中，对吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1595.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"8fc2f3b627be47bbb9cdcb6004d594f95573a25b08f0514c2cf209938518d6a4","ja":"私も面白いクッキー作りたくなってきた。\n食紅で色付けてカラフルクッキーとかどうや？","zh":"我也想做点有趣的饼干了。\n用食用色素上色，做成五彩缤纷的饼干怎么样？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1595.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"8197c76eb2bb9a14f0cf9513cd53c6fb5ea9a22c4478611b540e9bf86319160e","ja":"なら、野菜とか練り込むのもいいと思うぜ。\n栄養が摂れてカラフルで、一石二鳥だろ！","zh":"那把蔬菜之类的揉进去也不错啊。\n既能补充营养又色彩丰富，一举两得吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1595.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"4478762134ccf45a10e02e87a1aed8e156a6e31bcb45de46940fb591db8e0e39","ja":"めっちゃええやん！　あとは……。","zh":"太棒了吧！剩下的就是……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1595.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"60e2276c927fe1f702e553edfe565e4d3cfe70bb69be2f6b4836e698fe3a6355","ja":"スパイスクッキーとかもアリちゃう？\n体あっためられるジンジャーとか、シナモン入れて！","zh":"做成香料饼干好像也不错吧？\n加入能暖身子的生姜或者肉桂之类的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1595.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"a18f8a56dfbf36484825bc514547f474a9447cd6fb55f3a79c095118c1b471ab","ja":"砂糖控えめにしてカレー粉とか、\n唐辛子なんかを入れても面白いかもな！","zh":"少放点糖，加点咖喱粉或者\n辣椒之类的进去，说不定也挺有意思的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1595.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"a9c3a219ea5b6da5d84e4a733ac2f2e6fdbe3ca712929d313f137966cb011cbc","ja":"他にもハーブ入りクッキーとか……\nよーし、とにかくいろいろ買ってみようぜ！","zh":"还有加了香草的饼干之类的……\n好——总之多买些不同的尝尝吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1595.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"a0698b81a6c565691221acdb32f216338fb49ab71061784e844c7690f6429c6c","ja":"そしてふたりは、クッキーづくりを始めて……","zh":"接着两人开始做起了饼干……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1595.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"e1029c29c625069417665e0365fb747a12b02898d3b013237c0d57eaea83423c","ja":"虹の形のクッキー！？　しかも\n七枚くっつけてるから、すっげーデカいじゃん！","zh":"彩虹形状的饼干！？而且\n因为拼了七块在一起，所以超级大啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1595.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"5dbe5fcd42d413d4cae95b2f07edf0695282253621992529380866bdc6a9b86e","ja":"見た目のインパクトだけやないで！　紫キャベツとか\n人参とかで色付けしたから、栄養たっぷりや♪","zh":"可不只是外观引人注目哦！是用紫甘蓝和\n胡萝卜等蔬菜上的色，营养超级丰富呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1595.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"e45206db1d1ceaffd3d63c54dffaa9cb6002d93b9faf32cc9f8e728f931bf1f7","ja":"へへっ、インパクトならオレも負けてないぜ！\nじゃじゃ～ん！　兄ちゃんの顔型クッキー！　等身大！","zh":"嘿嘿，要比冲击力的话，我也不会输的！\n锵锵～！哥哥脸型饼干！等身大的哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1595.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"9b25a68974efa5f7e702fbdf02c3558d8c945b480d2b26ece0425d5e71ae4cf6","ja":"チョコペンでイラストまで描いてるやん！？\nこれは私も負けてられへんな～！","zh":"居然还用巧克力笔画了插图！？\n这我也不能认输啦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
